[2025-07-19 17:15:58] [DEBUG   ] discord.gateway - received_message:501: For Shard ID None: WebSocket Event: {'t': 'MESSAGE_CREATE', 's': 8, 'op': 0, 'd': {'type': 0, 'tts': False, 'timestamp': '2025-07-19T05:15:57.906000+00:00', 'pinned': False, 'nonce': '136319161829229288', 'mentions': [], 'mention_roles': [], 'mention_everyone': False, 'member': {'roles': ['1322422404810805321', '1322337241363648563'], 'premium_since': None, 'pending': False, 'nick': None, 'mute': False, 'joined_at': '2024-12-28T04:34:30.816000+00:00', 'flags': 0, 'deaf': False, 'communication_disabled_until': None, 'banner': None, 'avatar': None}, 'id': '1395997573512298598', 'flags': 0, 'embeds': [], 'edited_timestamp': None, 'content': "##New Game##\n--------------------------\n**Game Starting Soon!**\n\n**Mafia Game Rules:**\n1. **Objective:** The Town must eliminate all Mafia members and the Serial Killer. The Mafia must outnumber the Town. The Serial Killer must be the last player standing.\n2. **Phases:** The game alternates between Day and Night phases.\n3. **Day Phase:** Players discuss and vote to lynch someone. Voting is done via the `/vote` command.\n4. **Night Phase:** Mafia members choose a player to kill. The Serial Killer also chooses a player to kill. Some Town roles may have night actions.\n5. **Voting:** During the Day phase, players can vote for another player using the `/vote @player` command. The player with the most votes at the end of the Day phase is lynched.\n6. **Role Actions:** Some roles have special actions that can be performed during the Night phase. These actions are communicated to the bot via DM.\n7. **Winning:** The game ends when one faction achieves its win condition.\n8. **No Meta-Gaming:** Do not discuss the game outside of the designated channels or after you are dead.\n9. **No Sharing Role Information:** Do not share screenshots or verbatim copies of messages from the bot regarding your role or actions.\n10. **Inactivity:** Players who are inactive for extended periods may be removed from the game.\n11. **Have Fun:** Remember, it's just a game! Enjoy the experience and the company of your fellow players.", 'components': [], 'channel_type': 0, 'channel_id': '1322337015085142026', 'author': {'username': 'ICMafiaBot (Alpha)', 'public_flags': 0, 'primary_guild': None, 'id': '1322419670728441869', 'global_name': None, 'display_name_styles': None, 'discriminator': '6617', 'collectibles': None, 'clan': None, 'bot': True, 'avatar_decoration_data': None, 'avatar': '2fa7144b9b07b23793591047978d8a5a'}, 'attachments': [], 'guild_id': '1322335699684294656'}}
